<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT HALL OF FAME CHAMPIONSHIPS MONDAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT HALL OF FAME CHAMPIONSHIPS MONDAY.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT, Rhode Island 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on Monday</p>
<p>at the $255,000 Hall of Fame Tennis Championships (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>4-Sandon Stolle (Australia) beat Steve Campbell (U.S.) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>5-Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) beat Daniel Nestor (Canada) 7-6 (7-3) 7-5</p>
<p>7-Leander Paes (India) beat Fernan Wibier (Netherlands) 7-5 6-7 (4-7) 6-4</p>
<p>8-Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat Luis Herrera (Mexico) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Doug Flach (U.S.) beat Dick Norman (Belgium) 5-7 6-3 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Stephane Simian (France) beat Eyal Ran (Israel) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Ben Ellwood (Australia) beat Gaston Etlis (Argentina) 7-6 (7-5) 6-2</p>
</text>
